# QuantSim — .gitignore
# Aligned with README.md, AGENTS.md: Go backend, React frontend, Postgres, Redis, Docker, Terraform

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment & secrets (do not commit .env; use env vars or secrets manager)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local
secrets/
*.pem
*.key

# Private working notes. Kept locally, deliberately not published: these record
# personal context behind project decisions rather than the decisions themselves,
# which live in agents.md and the archived specs.
docs/intent/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Go
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Binaries
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
/bin/

# Test and coverage
*.test
*.out
coverage.html
coverage.txt
*.cover
*.coverprofile

# Go workspace and vendor (uncomment if using go mod vendor)
# /vendor/

# Dependency and build cache.
#
# go.work itself is tracked on purpose, so this does not list it. Builds do not
# need it -- every service module carries `replace ... => ../../pkg` and the
# Makefile builds each module from its own directory -- but committing it gives
# a fresh clone working cross-module resolution in gopls without setup. It holds
# only relative paths, so there is nothing machine-specific to leak. Only the
# generated sum file is ignored.
go.work.sum

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Node / React frontend
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.pnpm-store/
.npm
.yarn/
.pnp.*
.next/
out/
build/
dist/
.cache/
*.tsbuildinfo
.parcel-cache/
.turbo/
storybook-static/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IDE & editors
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.claude/
.cursor/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.project
.classpath
.settings/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Docker
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local overrides (keep docker-compose.yml tracked)
docker-compose.override.yml
docker-compose.*.local.yml

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Terraform (infra/)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.terraform/
.terraform.lock.hcl
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
.terraform.tfstate.lock.info
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Kubernetes
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.kubeconfig
kubeconfig*

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Logs, temp, and local data
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
logs/
*.log
tmp/
temp/
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak

# Local DB dumps and dev data (do not commit)
*.sql.gz
*.dump
/data/
/postgres_data/
/redis_data/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python (stretch: script-based strategies / sandbox)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.Python
venv/
.venv/
env/
.env/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
*.egg

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build and binary artifacts
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.bin
*.a
*.lib

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Misc
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pid
*.seed
*.pid.lock
